OL,3,GNEWSABirth excitement 'turns to worry' 
OL,4,Aover maternity move                    
OL,6,FA couple who are expecting their first 
OL,7,Fchild have said their excitement has   
OL,8,Fturned "into complete worry" because of
OL,9,Fthe suspension of maternity services at
OL,10,Ftheir local hospital.                  
OL,12,FShelly Magee was due to give birth in  
OL,13,FNewry's Daisy Hill Hospital in January 
OL,14,Fbut from Monday, the Southern Trust is 
OL,15,Fmoving all hospital-based births to    
OL,16,FCraigavon.                             
OL,18,FHer partner, Clinton McKeever, said    
OL,19,Fthey are now dreading the much longer  
OL,20,Fjourney from their home in Mullaghbawn 
OL,21,Fto Craigavon in the middle of winter.  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
