OL,3,GNEWSABirth excitement 'turns to worry' 
OL,4,Aover maternity move                    
OL,6,FThe trust announced the temporary      
OL,7,Fsuspension of maternity services at    
OL,8,FDaisy Hill in September, saying it had 
OL,9,Fbeen unable to recruit enough          
OL,10,Fconsultant obstetricians to maintain a 
OL,11,Fsafe service for both mums and babies. 
